// {U(1), SU(2), SU(3)}, exactly 4 support coherent standing waves:
//   U(1) alone (photon)
//   SU(3) alone (gluons)
//   U(1) x SU(2) (leptons, W/Z, Higgs)
//   U(1) x SU(2) x SU(3) (quarks)
//
// Theorem 5.8 (Completeness): 48 fermions + 12 vector bosons +
// 1 scalar = 61 particles, matching the Standard Model exactly.
